# What Cloud Build receives when deploying with `gcloud run deploy --source .`
#
# Written deliberately rather than letting gcloud generate one: an auto-generated
# file lands untracked and its contents are not reviewed. Secrets must never enter
# the build context — production values live on the Cloud Run service, not in the
# image (DEPLOYMENT.md → Environment variables).
#
# This governs the UPLOAD. `.dockerignore` separately governs what `COPY . .`
# puts inside the image.

.git
.gitignore
.gcloudignore

# Secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Rebuilt inside the container; uploading them is slow and can poison the build.
node_modules
.next
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Documentation and local tooling are not build inputs.
*.md
.claude

# Local noise.
.DS_Store
*.log
.playwright-mcp
